  "map_info": {
    "name": "Trans_Translation",
    "lookup_name": "Trans_Translation",
    "description": "Seven rides through x, y and z: depth, sideways, lift, high crossing, reverse x, a down-and-forward escalator ride and a final x/z diagonal. Thirteen vertically bobbing pickups hang along the journeys. Translation only: the carriers never rotate or scale. Two grabbable door studies on the exit terrace compare an axis-locked route with a free path to the same corner.",
